      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\3080\\5040\\3080-5040-0027.flac",
      "reference": "WELL IN SOBER EARNEST NOW I WOULD NOT LIVE THUS A TWELVEMONTH TO GAIN ALL THAT THE KING HAS LOST UNLESS IT WERE TO GIVE IT HIM AGAIN",
      "hypothesis": "Well, in sober earnest now, I would not live thus a twelve months to gain all that the king has lost, unless it were to give it him again.",
