      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\3080\\5040\\3080-5040-0029.flac",
      "reference": "HE HAS ONE SON AND TIS THE FINEST BOY THAT E'ER YOU SAW AND HAS A NOBLE SPIRIT BUT YET STANDS IN THAT AWE OF HIS FATHER THAT ONE WORD FROM HIM IS AS MUCH AS TWENTY WHIPPINGS",
      "hypothesis": "He has one son, and 'tis the finest boy that ever you saw, and has a noble spirit, but yet stands in that awe of his father that one word from him is as much as twenty whippings.",
