      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\3080\\5040\\3080-5040-0032.flac",
      "reference": "IN MY LIFE I NEVER HEARD SO RIDICULOUS A DISCOURSE AS HE MADE US AND NO OLD WOMAN WHO PASSES FOR A WITCH COULD HAVE BEEN MORE PUZZLED TO SEEK WHAT TO SAY TO REASONABLE PEOPLE THAN HE WAS",
      "hypothesis": "In my life, I never heard so ridiculous a discourse as he made us. No old woman who passes for a witch could have been more puzzled to seek what to say to reasonable people than he was.",
