      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\4294\\14317\\4294-14317-0000.flac",
      "reference": "AS I THOUGHT THAT THIS WAS DUE TO SOME FAULT IN THE EARTH I WANTED TO MAKE THESE FIRST EXPERIMENTS BEFORE I UNDERTOOK MY PERSEUS",
      "hypothesis": "As I thought that this was due to some fault in the Earth, I wanted to make these first experiments before I undertook my Perseus.",
