      "total_time": 20.528877019882202,
      "first_token_latency": 0.9123332500457764,
      "avg_processing_time": 15.773877019882203
    },
    {
      "file_id": "4350-9170-0008",
      "speaker_id": "4350",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\4350\\9170\\4350-9170-0008.flac",
      "reference": "THE ARMY HAS ALWAYS BEEN AND STILL IS THE BASIS OF POWER",
      "hypothesis": "The Army has always been and still is the basis of power.",
      "duration": 3.535,
      "total_time": 20.760980367660522,
      "first_token_latency": 0.8165655136108398,
      "avg_processing_time": 17.225980367660522
    },
    {
      "file_id": "4350-9170-0009",
      "speaker_id": "4350",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\4350\\9170\\4350-9170-0009.flac",
      "reference": "POWER IS ALWAYS IN THE HANDS OF THOSE WHO CONTROL THE ARMY AND ALL MEN IN POWER FROM THE ROMAN CAESARS TO THE RUSSIAN AND GERMAN EMPERORS TAKE MORE INTEREST IN THEIR ARMY THAN IN ANYTHING AND COURT POPULARITY IN THE ARMY KNOWING THAT IF THAT IS ON THEIR SIDE THEIR POWER IS SECURE",
      "hypothesis": "Power is always in the hands of those who control the army, and all men in power, from the Roman Caesars to the Russian and German emperors, take more interest in their army than in anything,",
      "duration": 13.95,
      "total_time": 21.422819137573242,
      "first_token_latency": 1.5075578689575195,
      "avg_processing_time": 7.472819137573243
    },
    {
      "file_id": "4350-9170-0011",
      "speaker_id": "4350",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\4350\\9170\\4350-9170-0011.flac",
      "reference": "ONLY UNDER THOSE CONDITIONS COULD THE SOCIAL ORGANIZATION BE JUSTIFIED",
      "hypothesis": "Only under those conditions could the social organization be justified.",
      "duration": 3.745,
      "total_time": 20.4927921295166,
      "first_token_latency": 0.8707962036132812,
      "avg_processing_time": 16.7477921295166
    },
    {
      "file_id": "4350-9170-0013",
      "speaker_id": "4350",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\4350\\9170\\4350-9170-0013.flac",
      "reference": "EVEN IF THERE WAS ONCE A TIME WHEN OWING TO THE LOW STANDARD OF MORALS AND THE DISPOSITION OF MEN TO VIOLENCE THE EXISTENCE OF AN AUTHORITY TO RESTRAIN SUCH VIOLENCE WAS AN ADVANTAGE BECAUSE THE VIOLENCE OF GOVERNMENT WAS LESS THAN THE VIOLENCE OF INDIVIDUALS ONE CANNOT BUT SEE THAT THIS ADVANTAGE COULD NOT BE LASTING",
      "hypothesis": "Even if there was once a time when, owing to the low standards of morals and the disposition of men to violence, the existence of an authority to restrain such violence was an advantage,",
      "duration": 15.405,
      "total_time": 21.32224702835083,
      "first_token_latency": 1.4066848754882812,
      "avg_processing_time": 5.917247028350831
    },
    {
      "file_id": "4350-9170-0014",
      "speaker_id": "4350",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\4350\\9170\\4350-9170-0014.flac",
      "reference": "BETWEEN THE MEMBERS OF ONE STATE SUBJECT TO A SINGLE AUTHORITY THE STRIFE BETWEEN INDIVIDUALS SEEMS STILL LESS AND THE LIFE OF THE STATE SEEMS EVEN MORE SECURE",
      "hypothesis": "Between the members of one state, subject to a single authority, the strife between the individuals seems still less, and the life of the state seems even more secure.",
      "duration": 8.745,
      "total_time": 21.32131862640381,
