      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\533\\131556\\533-131556-0002.flac",
      "reference": "THE WORD STARES ME IN THE FACE LIKE A GUILTY CONFESSION BUT IT IS TRUE I HATE HIM I HATE HIM",
      "hypothesis": "The word stares me in the face like a guilty confession, but it is true. I hate him. I hate him.",
