      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\533\\131556\\533-131556-0004.flac",
      "reference": "I HAVE DONE WELL TO RECORD THEM SO MINUTELY",
      "hypothesis": "I've done well to record them so minutely.",
