      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\533\\131556\\533-131556-0005.flac",
      "reference": "THEY HAD BETAKEN THEMSELVES TO THEIR WORK I LESS TO DIVERT MY MIND THAN TO DEPRECATE CONVERSATION HAD PROVIDED MYSELF WITH A BOOK",
      "hypothesis": "They had taken themselves to their work. I, less to divert my mind than to duplicate conversation, had provided myself with the book.",
