      "total_time": 20.80790138244629,
      "first_token_latency": 0.8605790138244629,
      "avg_processing_time": 16.87790138244629
    },
    {
      "file_id": "533-131556-0011",
      "speaker_id": "533",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\533\\131556\\533-131556-0011.flac",
      "reference": "IF I WERE SUSPICIOUS I REPLIED I SHOULD HAVE DISCOVERED YOUR INFAMY LONG BEFORE",
      "hypothesis": "If I were suspicious, I replied,",
      "duration": 6.56,
      "total_time": 21.306845903396606,
      "first_token_latency": 1.5388386249542236,
      "avg_processing_time": 14.746845903396608
    },
    {
      "file_id": "533-131556-0012",
      "speaker_id": "533",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\533\\131556\\533-131556-0012.flac",
      "reference": "I ENJOY A MOONLIGHT RAMBLE AS WELL AS YOU I ANSWERED STEADILY FIXING MY EYES UPON HER AND THE SHRUBBERY HAPPENS TO BE ONE OF MY FAVOURITE RESORTS",
      "hypothesis": "I enjoy Human Life Ramble as well as you, I answered, steadily fixing my eyes upon her, and the shrubbery happens to be one of my favorite resorts.",
      "duration": 11.93,
      "total_time": 21.36965775489807,
      "first_token_latency": 1.3372864723205566,
      "avg_processing_time": 9.439657754898072
    },
    {
      "file_id": "533-131556-0013",
      "speaker_id": "533",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\533\\131556\\533-131556-0013.flac",
      "reference": "SHE COLOURED AGAIN EXCESSIVELY AND REMAINED SILENT PRESSING HER FINGER AGAINST HER TEETH AND GAZING INTO THE FIRE",
      "hypothesis": "She colored again excessively and remained silent, pressing her finger against her teeth and gazing into the fire.",
