      "total_time": 21.282453060150146,
      "first_token_latency": 1.3205385208129883,
      "avg_processing_time": 13.807453060150147
    },
    {
      "file_id": "533-131556-0014",
      "speaker_id": "533",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\533\\131556\\533-131556-0014.flac",
      "reference": "I WATCHED HER A FEW MOMENTS WITH A FEELING OF MALEVOLENT GRATIFICATION THEN MOVING TOWARDS THE DOOR I CALMLY ASKED IF SHE HAD ANYTHING MORE TO SAY",
      "hypothesis": "I watched her a few moments to the feeling of malevolent gratification. Then, moving towards the door, I calmly asked if she had anything more to say.",
      "duration": 9.665,
      "total_time": 21.10063886642456,
      "first_token_latency": 1.1564052104949951,
      "avg_processing_time": 11.435638866424561
    },
    {
      "file_id": "533-131556-0017",
      "speaker_id": "533",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\533\\131556\\533-131556-0017.flac",
      "reference": "SHE PAUSED IN EVIDENT DISCONCERTION AND PERPLEXITY MINGLED WITH ANGER SHE DARED NOT SHOW",
      "hypothesis": "She paused, in evident disconcertion and perplexity, mingled with anger she dared not show.",
      "duration": 6.42,
      "total_time": 20.946240186691284,
      "first_token_latency": 0.9289722442626953,
      "avg_processing_time": 14.526240186691284
    },
    {
      "file_id": "533-131556-0019",
      "speaker_id": "533",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\533\\131556\\533-131556-0019.flac",
      "reference": "IF YOU ARE GENEROUS HERE IS A FITTING OPPORTUNITY FOR THE EXERCISE OF YOUR MAGNANIMITY IF YOU ARE PROUD HERE AM I YOUR RIVAL READY TO ACKNOWLEDGE MYSELF YOUR DEBTOR FOR AN ACT OF THE MOST NOBLE FORBEARANCE",
      "hypothesis": "If you are generous, here is a fitting opportunity for the exercise of your magnanimity. If you are proud, here am I, your rival, ready to acknowledge myself your adopter for an act of the most noble forbearance.",
      "duration": 15.22,
      "total_time": 21.301608562469482,
      "first_token_latency": 0.5077769756317139,
      "avg_processing_time": 6.081608562469482
    },
    {
      "file_id": "533-131556-0023",
      "speaker_id": "533",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\533\\131556\\533-131556-0023.flac",
      "reference": "I WOULD NOT FOR MUCH THAT SHE SHOULD KNOW THE INFAMY AND DISGRACE OF HER RELATION",
      "hypothesis": "I would not for much that you should know the infamy and disgrace of a relation.",
      "duration": 4.725,
      "total_time": 20.462281227111816,
      "first_token_latency": 0.5250070095062256,
      "avg_processing_time": 15.737281227111817
    },
    {
