      "speaker_id": "533",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\533\\131556\\533-131556-0024.flac",
      "reference": "YOU USE HARD WORDS MISSUS HUNTINGDON BUT I CAN PARDON YOU",
      "hypothesis": "You use hard words, Mrs. Huntington, but I can pardon you.",
      "duration": 4.38,
      "total_time": 20.513522624969482,
      "first_token_latency": 0.5611844062805176,
      "avg_processing_time": 16.133522624969483
    },
    {
      "file_id": "533-131562-0000",
      "speaker_id": "533",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\533\\131562\\533-131562-0000.flac",
      "reference": "IT SEEMS VERY INTERESTING LOVE SAID HE LIFTING HIS HEAD AND TURNING TO WHERE I STOOD WRINGING MY HANDS IN SILENT RAGE AND ANGUISH BUT IT'S RATHER LONG I'LL LOOK AT IT SOME OTHER TIME AND MEANWHILE I'LL TROUBLE YOU FOR YOUR KEYS MY DEAR WHAT KEYS",
      "hypothesis": "\"It seems very interesting, love,\" said he, lifting his head and turning to where I stood, wringing my hand in silent rage and anguish. \"But it's rather long.",
      "duration": 18.64,
      "total_time": 21.9178946018219,
      "first_token_latency": 1.8092999458312988,
      "avg_processing_time": 3.277894601821899
    },
    {
      "file_id": "533-131562-0001",
      "speaker_id": "533",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\533\\131562\\533-131562-0001.flac",
      "reference": "THE KEYS OF YOUR CABINET DESK DRAWERS AND WHATEVER ELSE YOU POSSESS SAID HE RISING AND HOLDING OUT HIS HAND",
      "hypothesis": "the keys of your cabinet, desk, drawer, and whatever else you possess. Say he, rising and holding out his hand.",
      "duration": 8.45,
      "total_time": 21.46922469139099,
      "first_token_latency": 1.5213994979858398,
      "avg_processing_time": 13.019224691390992
    },
    {
      "file_id": "533-131562-0002",
      "speaker_id": "533",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\533\\131562\\533-131562-0002.flac",
      "reference": "THE KEY OF MY DESK IN FACT WAS AT THAT MOMENT IN THE LOCK AND THE OTHERS WERE ATTACHED TO IT",
      "hypothesis": "The key of my desk, in fact, was at that moment in the lock, and the others were attached to it.",
      "duration": 6.11,
      "total_time": 20.541842222213745,
      "first_token_latency": 0.9839305877685547,
      "avg_processing_time": 14.431842222213746
    },
    {
      "file_id": "533-131562-0003",
      "speaker_id": "533",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\533\\131562\\533-131562-0003.flac",
      "reference": "NOW THEN SNEERED HE WE MUST HAVE A CONFISCATION OF PROPERTY",
