      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\533\\131562\\533-131562-0009.flac",
      "reference": "I SHALL PUT YOU UPON A SMALL MONTHLY ALLOWANCE IN FUTURE FOR YOUR OWN PRIVATE EXPENSES AND YOU NEEDN'T TROUBLE YOURSELF ANY MORE ABOUT MY CONCERNS I SHALL LOOK OUT FOR A STEWARD MY DEAR I WON'T EXPOSE YOU TO THE TEMPTATION",
      "hypothesis": "I shall put you up on a small monthly allowance in future for your own private expenses. And you needn't trouble yourself any more about my concerns. I shall look out for a steward, my dear. I won't expose you to the temptation.",
      "duration": 14.805,
      "total_time": 21.4773907661438,
      "first_token_latency": 1.564650535583496,
      "avg_processing_time": 6.672390766143799
    },
    {
      "file_id": "533-131562-0010",
      "speaker_id": "533",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\533\\131562\\533-131562-0010.flac",
      "reference": "AND AS FOR THE HOUSEHOLD MATTERS MISSUS GREAVES MUST BE VERY PARTICULAR IN KEEPING HER ACCOUNTS WE MUST GO UPON AN ENTIRELY NEW PLAN",
