      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\7018\\75788\\7018-75788-0002.flac",
      "reference": "HEARING THIS I WAS SORE TROUBLED REMEMBERING WHAT I HAD BEFORE SUFFERED FROM THE APE KIND",
      "hypothesis": "Hearing this, I was so troubled remembering what I had before suffered from the ape kind.",
