      "speaker_id": "7018",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\7018\\75788\\7018-75788-0003.flac",
      "reference": "UPON THIS HE BROUGHT ME A COTTON BAG AND GIVING IT TO ME SAID TAKE THIS BAG AND FILL IT WITH PEBBLES FROM THE BEACH AND GO FORTH WITH A COMPANY OF THE TOWNSFOLK TO WHOM I WILL GIVE A CHARGE RESPECTING THEE",
      "hypothesis": "Upon this he bought me a cotton bag and given it to me said, \"Take this bag and fill it with pebbles from the beach and go forth with the company of the townsfolk to whom I will give a charge respecting thee.\"",
      "duration": 13.335,
      "total_time": 21.416741371154785,
      "first_token_latency": 1.4276912212371826,
      "avg_processing_time": 8.081741371154784
    },
    {
      "file_id": "7018-75788-0004",
      "speaker_id": "7018",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\7018\\75788\\7018-75788-0004.flac",
      "reference": "DO AS THEY DO AND BELIKE THOU SHALT GAIN WHAT MAY FURTHER THY RETURN VOYAGE TO THY NATIVE LAND",
      "hypothesis": "Do as they do, and be like thou shalt gain what may further thy return voyage to thy native land.",
      "duration": 6.845,
      "total_time": 21.40337324142456,
      "first_token_latency": 1.3865444660186768,
      "avg_processing_time": 14.558373241424562
    },
    {
      "file_id": "7018-75788-0007",
      "speaker_id": "7018",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\7018\\75788\\7018-75788-0007.flac",
      "reference": "NOW SLEEPING UNDER THESE TREES WERE MANY APES WHICH WHEN THEY SAW US ROSE AND FLED FROM US AND SWARMED UP AMONG THE BRANCHES WHEREUPON MY COMPANIONS BEGAN TO PELT THEM WITH WHAT THEY HAD IN THEIR BAGS AND THE APES FELL TO PLUCKING OF THE FRUIT OF THE TREES AND CASTING THEM AT THE FOLK",
      "hypothesis": "Now sleeping under these trees were many apes, which, when they saw us, rose and fled from us, and swarmed up among the branches,",
      "duration": 18.68,
      "total_time": 21.747902631759644,
      "first_token_latency": 1.5826032161712646,
      "avg_processing_time": 3.067902631759644
    },
    {
      "file_id": "7018-75788-0011",
      "speaker_id": "7018",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\7018\\75788\\7018-75788-0011.flac",
      "reference": "THERE I ABODE A LITTLE AND THEN WENT ON TO BAGHDAD WHERE I ENTERED MY QUARTER AND FOUND MY HOUSE AND FOREGATHERED WITH MY FAMILY AND SALUTED MY FRIENDS WHO GAVE ME JOY OF MY SAFE RETURN AND I LAID UP ALL MY GOODS AND VALUABLES IN MY STOREHOUSES",
      "hypothesis": "There I abode a little and then went on to Bagh",
      "duration": 16.845,
      "total_time": 55.14412236213684,
      "first_token_latency": 35.124722957611084,
      "avg_processing_time": 38.29912236213684
    },
    {
      "file_id": "7018-75788-0013",
      "speaker_id": "7018",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\7018\\75788\\7018-75788-0013.flac",
      "reference": "NEXT MORNING AS SOON AS IT WAS LIGHT HE PRAYED THE DAWN PRAYER AND AFTER BLESSING MOHAMMED THE CREAM OF ALL CREATURES BETOOK HIMSELF TO THE HOUSE OF SINDBAD THE SEAMAN AND WISHED HIM A GOOD DAY",
      "hypothesis": "next morning, as soon as it was light, he prayed the dawn prayer and, after blessing Muhammad the cream of all creatures, he took himself to the house of Sinbad the seaman and wished him a good day.",
      "duration": 13.605,
      "total_time": 21.741227865219116,
      "first_token_latency": 1.8273262977600098,
      "avg_processing_time": 8.136227865219116
    },
    {
      "file_id": "7018-75788-0015",
      "speaker_id": "7018",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\7018\\75788\\7018-75788-0015.flac",
      "reference": "HAPLY AMONGST YOU IS ONE RIGHTEOUS WHOSE PRAYERS THE LORD WILL ACCEPT",
      "hypothesis": "Happily amongst you is one righteous whose prayers the Lord will accept.",
      "duration": 5.095,
      "total_time": 20.488397121429443,
      "first_token_latency": 0.5679094791412354,
      "avg_processing_time": 15.393397121429444
    },
    {
      "file_id": "7018-75788-0018",
      "speaker_id": "7018",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\7018\\75788\\7018-75788-0018.flac",
      "reference": "EACH THAT DIED WE WASHED AND SHROUDED IN SOME OF THE CLOTHES AND LINEN CAST ASHORE BY THE TIDES AND AFTER A LITTLE THE REST OF MY FELLOWS PERISHED ONE BY ONE TILL I HAD BURIED THE LAST OF THE PARTY AND ABODE ALONE ON THE ISLAND WITH BUT A LITTLE PROVISION LEFT I WHO WAS WONT TO HAVE SO MUCH",
      "hypothesis": "Each that died we washed, and shrouded in some of the clothes and linen cast ashore by the tides. And after little the rest of my fellows perished,",
      "duration": 20.84,
      "total_time": 24.15920329093933,
      "first_token_latency": 1.1662850379943848,
      "avg_processing_time": 3.319203290939331
    },
    {
      "file_id": "7018-75789-0001",
      "speaker_id": "7018",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\7018\\75789\\7018-75789-0001.flac",
      "reference": "THEN SIGHING FOR MYSELF I SET TO WORK COLLECTING A NUMBER OF PIECES OF CHINESE AND COMORIN ALOES WOOD AND I BOUND THEM TOGETHER WITH ROPES FROM THE WRECKAGE THEN I CHOSE OUT FROM THE BROKEN UP SHIPS STRAIGHT PLANKS OF EVEN SIZE AND FIXED THEM FIRMLY UPON THE ALOES WOOD MAKING ME A BOAT RAFT A LITTLE NARROWER THAN THE CHANNEL OF THE STREAM AND I TIED IT TIGHTLY AND FIRMLY AS THOUGH IT WERE NAILED",
      "hypothesis": "Then, signed for myself, I set to work collecting a number of pieces of Chinese and Cormoran Aloe's wood, and I bound them together with ropes from the wreckage.",
      "duration": 25.39,
      "total_time": 22.57837963104248,
      "first_token_latency": 2.0208852291107178,
      "avg_processing_time": 22.57837963104248
    },
    {
      "file_id": "7018-75789-0003",
      "speaker_id": "7018",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\7018\\75789\\7018-75789-0003.flac",
      "reference": "I ROWED MY CONVEYANCE INTO THE PLACE WHICH WAS INTENSELY DARK AND THE CURRENT CARRIED THE RAFT WITH IT DOWN THE UNDERGROUND CHANNEL",
      "hypothesis": "I rode my conveyance into the place, which was intensely dark,, and the current carried the raft with it down the underground channel.",
      "duration": 8.69,
      "total_time": 21.00202751159668,
      "first_token_latency": 1.084852695465088,
      "avg_processing_time": 12.31202751159668
    },
    {
      "file_id": "7018-75789-0007",
      "speaker_id": "7018",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\7018\\75789\\7018-75789-0007.flac",
      "reference": "WHEN THEY SAW I UNDERSTOOD THEM NOT AND MADE THEM NO ANSWER ONE OF THEM CAME FORWARD AND SAID TO ME IN ARABIC PEACE BE WITH THEE O MY BROTHER",
      "hypothesis": "When they saw I understood them not and made them no answer, one of them came forward and said to me in Arabic,",
      "duration": 9.215,
      "total_time": 18.68699312210083,
      "first_token_latency": 1.0190963745117188,
      "avg_processing_time": 9.47199312210083
    },
    {
      "file_id": "7018-75789-0008",
      "speaker_id": "7018",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\7018\\75789\\7018-75789-0008.flac",
      "reference": "O MY BROTHER ANSWERED HE WE ARE HUSBANDMEN AND TILLERS OF THE SOIL WHO CAME OUT TO WATER OUR FIELDS AND PLANTATIONS AND FINDING THEE ASLEEP ON THIS RAFT LAID HOLD OF IT AND MADE IT FAST BY US AGAINST THOU SHOULDST AWAKE AT THY LEISURE",
      "hypothesis": "\"Oh my brother,\" answered he, \"we are husbandmen and tillers of the soil, who came out to water our fields and plantations, and finding thee asleep on this raft, laid hold of it, and made it fast by us,",
      "duration": 17.27,
      "total_time": 22.079062700271606,
      "first_token_latency": 1.3282387256622314,
      "avg_processing_time": 4.809062700271607
