      "reference": "HENRY WASHINGTON YOUNGER MY FATHER REPRESENTED JACKSON COUNTY THREE TIMES IN THE LEGISLATURE AND WAS ALSO JUDGE OF THE COUNTY COURT",
      "hypothesis": "Henry Washington Younger, my father, represented Jackson County three times in the legislature and was also a judge of the county court.",
