      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\7975\\280057\\7975-280057-0017.flac",
      "reference": "FROM HARRISONVILLE SHE WENT TO WAVERLY WHERE SHE WAS HOUNDED CONTINUALLY",
      "hypothesis": "From Harrisonville, she went to Waverly, where she was hounded continually.",
