      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\7975\\280057\\7975-280057-0019.flac",
      "reference": "ONE OF MY OLD SCHOOL TEACHERS WHOM I HAVE NEVER SEEN SINCE THE SPRING OR SUMMER OF EIGHTEEN SIXTY TWO IS STEPHEN B ELKINS SENATOR FROM WEST VIRGINIA",
      "hypothesis": "one of my old school teachers whom I have never seen since the spring or summer of 1862. It's Stephen B.. Elkins, Senator from West Virginia.",
