      "speaker_id": "7975",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\7975\\280063\\7975-280063-0002.flac",
      "reference": "ACCORDINGLY I WAS SHORTLY AWAKENED TO ACCOMPANY HIM TO LONE JACK WHERE HE WOULD PERSONALLY MAKE KNOWN THE SITUATION TO THE OTHER COLONELS",
      "hypothesis": "Accordingly, I was shortly awakened to accompany him to Lone Jack, where he would personally make known the situation to the other colonels.",
