      "reference": "MAJOR FOSTER IN A LETTER TO JUDGE GEORGE M BENNETT OF MINNEAPOLIS SAID",
      "hypothesis": "Major Foster, in a letter to Judge Georgian Bennett of Minneapolis, said",
