      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\7975\\280076\\7975-280076-0000.flac",
      "reference": "ALTHOUGH EVERY BOOK PURPORTING TO NARRATE THE LIVES OF THE YOUNGER BROTHERS HAS TOLD OF THE LIBERTY ROBBERY AND IMPLIED THAT WE HAD A PART IN IT THE YOUNGERS WERE NOT SUSPECTED AT THAT TIME NOR FOR A LONG TIME AFTERWARD",
      "hypothesis": "Although every book purporting to narrate the lives of the Younger Brothers is told of the Liberty robbery and implied that we had a part in it, the Youngers were not suspected at that time,",
