      "speaker_id": "7975",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\7975\\280076\\7975-280076-0003.flac",
      "reference": "NO WARRANT WAS ISSUED FOR THE YOUNGERS BUT SUBSEQUENT HISTORIANS HAVE INFERENTIALLY AT LEAST ACCUSED US OF TAKING PART BUT AS I SAID BEFORE THERE IS NO TRUTH IN THE ACCUSATION",
      "hypothesis": "No warrant was issued for the Youngers, but subsequent historians have inferentially at least accused us of taking part. But as I said before, there is no truth in the accusation.",
      "duration": 10.27,
      "total_time": 21.413519382476807,
      "first_token_latency": 1.4931421279907227,
      "avg_processing_time": 11.143519382476807
    },
    {
      "file_id": "7975-280076-0004",
      "speaker_id": "7975",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\7975\\280076\\7975-280076-0004.flac",
      "reference": "JUNE THIRD EIGHTEEN SEVENTY ONE OBOCOCK BROTHERS BANK AT CORYDON IOWA WAS ROBBED OF FORTY THOUSAND DOLLARS BY SEVEN MEN IN BROAD DAYLIGHT",
      "hypothesis": "June 3, 1871,",
      "duration": 8.31,
      "total_time": 17.253685235977173,
      "first_token_latency": 1.1942923069000244,
      "avg_processing_time": 8.943685235977172
    },
    {
      "file_id": "7975-280076-0005",
      "speaker_id": "7975",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\7975\\280076\\7975-280076-0005.flac",
      "reference": "IT WAS CHARGED THAT ARTHUR MC COY OR A C MC COY AND MYSELF HAD BEEN PARTICIPANTS IN THE GAD'S HILL AFFAIR AND THE TWO STAGE ROBBERIES",
      "hypothesis": "It was charged that Arthur McCoy or AC McCoy and myself had been participants in the Gadsill affair and the two stage rob robberies.",
      "duration": 7.98,
      "total_time": 21.318272352218628,
      "first_token_latency": 1.390230417251587,
      "avg_processing_time": 13.338272352218628
    },
    {
      "file_id": "7975-280076-0006",
      "speaker_id": "7975",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\7975\\280076\\7975-280076-0006.flac",
      "reference": "THE PARTS OF THIS LETTER NOW RELEVANT ARE AS FOLLOWS",
      "hypothesis": "Parts of this letter now relevant are as follows.",
      "duration": 3.28,
      "total_time": 20.435489416122437,
      "first_token_latency": 0.44989657402038574,
      "avg_processing_time": 17.155489416122435
    },
    {
      "file_id": "7975-280076-0008",
      "speaker_id": "7975",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\7975\\280076\\7975-280076-0008.flac",
      "reference": "I WILL GIVE YOU THIS OUTLINE AND SKETCH OF MY WHEREABOUTS AND ACTIONS AT THE TIME OF CERTAIN ROBBERIES WITH WHICH I AM CHARGED",
      "hypothesis": "I will give you this outline and sketch of my whereabouts and actions at the time of certain robberies with which I am",
      "duration": 6.16,
      "total_time": 20.896578550338745,
      "first_token_latency": 2.4121620655059814,
      "avg_processing_time": 14.736578550338745
    },
    {
      "file_id": "7975-280076-0009",
      "speaker_id": "7975",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\7975\\280076\\7975-280076-0009.flac",
      "reference": "AT THE TIME OF THE GALLATIN BANK ROBBERY I WAS GATHERING CATTLE IN ELLIS COUNTY TEXAS CATTLE THAT I BOUGHT FROM PLEAS TAYLOR AND RECTOR",
      "hypothesis": "At the time of the Gallatin bank robbery,",
      "duration": 7.24,
      "total_time": 17.332297563552856,
      "first_token_latency": 1.445173978805542,
      "avg_processing_time": 10.092297563552856
    },
    {
      "file_id": "7975-280076-0010",
      "speaker_id": "7975",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\7975\\280076\\7975-280076-0010.flac",
      "reference": "THIS CAN BE PROVED BY BOTH OF THEM ALSO BY SHERIFF BARKLEY AND FIFTY OTHER RESPECTABLE MEN OF THAT COUNTY",
      "hypothesis": "This can be proved by both of them,",
      "duration": 6.06,
      "total_time": 17.131239652633667,
      "first_token_latency": 1.2692043781280518,
      "avg_processing_time": 11.071239652633668
    },
    {
      "file_id": "7975-280076-0012",
      "speaker_id": "7975",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\7975\\280076\\7975-280076-0012.flac",
      "reference": "I THEN WENT TO ARKANSAS AND RETURNED TO SAINT CLAIR COUNTY ABOUT THE FIRST OF MAY",
      "hypothesis": "I then went to Arkansas and returned to St.",
      "duration": 4.41,
      "total_time": 20.795784950256348,
      "first_token_latency": 1.6854901313781738,
      "avg_processing_time": 16.385784950256348
    },
    {
      "file_id": "7975-280076-0014",
      "speaker_id": "7975",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\7975\\280076\\7975-280076-0014.flac",
      "reference": "DURING THE SUMMER I WAS EITHER IN SAINT CLAIR JACKSON OR KANSAS BUT AS THERE WAS NO ROBBERY COMMITTED THAT SUMMER IT MAKES NO DIFFERENCE WHERE I WAS",
      "hypothesis": "During the summer, I was either in St. Clair, Jackson, or Kansas, but as there was no robbery committed that summer, it makes no difference where I was.",
      "duration": 8.135,
      "total_time": 21.17065668106079,
      "first_token_latency": 1.2653775215148926,
      "avg_processing_time": 13.035656681060791
    },
    {
      "file_id": "7975-280076-0015",
      "speaker_id": "7975",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\7975\\280076\\7975-280076-0015.flac",
      "reference": "I WENT THROUGH INDEPENDENCE AND FROM THERE TO ACE WEBB'S",
      "hypothesis": "I went through independence and from there to Ace Webs.",
      "duration": 2.92,
      "total_time": 20.02242374420166,
      "first_token_latency": 0.4824659824371338,
      "avg_processing_time": 17.10242374420166
    },
    {
      "file_id": "7975-280076-0017",
      "speaker_id": "7975",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\7975\\280076\\7975-280076-0017.flac",
      "reference": "OUR BUSINESS THERE WAS TO SEE E P WEST HE WAS NOT AT HOME BUT THE FAMILY WILL REMEMBER THAT WE WERE THERE",
      "hypothesis": "Our business there was to see E.P.",
      "duration": 5.645,
      "total_time": 21.00956082344055,
      "first_token_latency": 1.415745496749878,
      "avg_processing_time": 15.364560823440552
    },
    {
      "file_id": "7975-280076-0018",
      "speaker_id": "7975",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\7975\\280076\\7975-280076-0018.flac",
      "reference": "WE CROSSED ON THE BRIDGE STAYED IN THE CITY ALL NIGHT AND THE NEXT MORNING WE RODE UP THROUGH THE CITY",
      "hypothesis": "We crossed on the bridge,",
      "duration": 4.88,
      "total_time": 20.588035345077515,
      "first_token_latency": 1.304781436920166,
      "avg_processing_time": 15.708035345077516
    },
    {
      "file_id": "7975-280076-0019",
      "speaker_id": "7975",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\7975\\280076\\7975-280076-0019.flac",
      "reference": "I MET SEVERAL OF MY FRIENDS AMONG THEM WAS BOB HUDSPETH",
      "hypothesis": "I met several of my friends. Among them was Bob Hudspeth.",
      "duration": 3.62,
      "total_time": 20.08376145362854,
      "first_token_latency": 0.4718751907348633,
      "avg_processing_time": 16.46376145362854
    },
    {
      "file_id": "7975-280076-0020",
      "speaker_id": "7975",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\7975\\280076\\7975-280076-0020.flac",
      "reference": "WE WERE NOT ON GOOD TERMS AT THE TIME NOR HAVE WE BEEN FOR SEVERAL YEARS",
      "hypothesis": "We were not on good terms at the time, nor have we been for several years.",
      "duration": 3.925,
      "total_time": 20.643368005752563,
      "first_token_latency": 1.0014698505401611,
      "avg_processing_time": 16.718368005752563
    },
    {
      "file_id": "7975-280076-0023",
      "speaker_id": "7975",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\7975\\280076\\7975-280076-0023.flac",
      "reference": "THERE WERE FIFTY OR A HUNDRED PERSONS THERE WHO WILL TESTIFY IN ANY COURT THAT JOHN AND I WERE THERE",
      "hypothesis": "There were 50 or 100 persons there who will testify in any court that John and I I",
      "duration": 5.325,
      "total_time": 20.771425247192383,
      "first_token_latency": 1.865858793258667,
      "avg_processing_time": 15.446425247192384
    },
    {
      "file_id": "7975-280076-0024",
      "speaker_id": "7975",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\7975\\280076\\7975-280076-0024.flac",
      "reference": "HELVIN FICKLE AND WIFE OF GREENTON VALLEY WERE ATTENDING THE SPRINGS AT THAT TIME AND EITHER OF THEM WILL TESTIFY TO THE ABOVE FOR JOHN AND I SAT IN FRONT OF MISTER SMITH WHILE HE WAS PREACHING AND WAS IN HIS COMPANY FOR A FEW MOMENTS TOGETHER WITH HIS WIFE AND MISTER AND MISSUS FICKLE AFTER SERVICE",
      "hypothesis": "Helvin Fickle and wife of Greenton Valley were attending the Springs at that time,",
      "duration": 15.585,
      "total_time": 18.78700065612793,
      "first_token_latency": 2.442516803741455,
      "avg_processing_time": 3.202000656127929
    },
    {
      "file_id": "7975-280076-0025",
      "speaker_id": "7975",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\7975\\280076\\7975-280076-0025.flac",
      "reference": "ABOUT THE LAST OF DECEMBER EIGHTEEN SEVENTY THREE I ARRIVED IN CARROLL PARISH LOUISIANA",
      "hypothesis": "About the last of December,",
      "duration": 5.485,
      "total_time": 20.792175769805908,
      "first_token_latency": 1.4588658809661865,
      "avg_processing_time": 15.307175769805909
    },
    {
      "file_id": "7975-280076-0027",
      "speaker_id": "7975",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\7975\\280076\\7975-280076-0027.flac",
      "reference": "I HAD NOT HEARD OF THAT WHEN I WROTE THE LETTER OF EIGHTEEN SEVENTY FOUR AND TO CORRECT ANY MISAPPREHENSION THAT MIGHT BE CREATED BY OMITTING IT I WILL SAY THAT AT THAT TIME I WAS AT NEOSHO KANSAS WITH A DROVE OF CATTLE WHICH I SOLD TO MAJOR RAY",
      "hypothesis": "I had not heard of that when I wrote the letter of 1874, and to correct any misapprehension that might be created by omitting it, I will say that at the time I was at Neosho, Kansas with a drove of cattle which I sold to Major Ray.",
      "duration": 14.0550625,
      "total_time": 21.521531581878662,
      "first_token_latency": 1.5906867980957031,
      "avg_processing_time": 7.466469081878662
    },
    {
      "file_id": "7975-280076-0028",
      "speaker_id": "7975",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\7975\\280076\\7975-280076-0028.flac",
      "reference": "IT WAS IMMEDIATELY FOLLOWING THE ROCK ISLAND ROBBERY AT ADAIR IOWA THAT THERE FIRST APPEARED A DELIBERATE ENLISTMENT OF SOME LOCAL PAPERS IN MISSOURI TO CONNECT US WITH THIS ROBBERY",
      "hypothesis": "It was immediately following the Rock Island robbery at 8 Air,",
      "duration": 9.525,
      "total_time": 17.622742176055908,
      "first_token_latency": 1.6317002773284912,
      "avg_processing_time": 8.097742176055908
    },
    {
      "file_id": "7975-280084-0000",
      "speaker_id": "7975",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\7975\\280084\\7975-280084-0000.flac",
      "reference": "I URGED ON THE BOYS THAT WHATEVER HAPPENED WE SHOULD NOT SHOOT ANY ONE",
      "hypothesis": "I urged on the boys that whatever happened, we should not shoot anyone.",
      "duration": 3.79,
      "total_time": 20.522876739501953,
      "first_token_latency": 0.8666424751281738,
      "avg_processing_time": 16.732876739501954
    },
    {
      "file_id": "7975-280084-0001",
      "speaker_id": "7975",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\7975\\280084\\7975-280084-0001.flac",
      "reference": "WHEN MILLER AND I CROSSED THE BRIDGE THE THREE WERE ON SOME DRY GOODS BOXES AT THE CORNER NEAR THE BANK AND AS SOON AS THEY SAW US WENT RIGHT INTO THE BANK INSTEAD OF WAITING FOR US TO GET THERE",
      "hypothesis": "When Miller and I crossed the bridge, the three were on some dry good boxes at the corner near the bank. And as soon as they saw us, went right into the bank instead of waiting for us to get there.",
      "duration": 10.1,
      "total_time": 21.31278920173645,
      "first_token_latency": 1.360722541809082,
      "avg_processing_time": 11.21278920173645
    },
    {
      "file_id": "7975-280084-0004",
      "speaker_id": "7975",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\7975\\280084\\7975-280084-0004.flac",
      "reference": "GET YOUR GUNS BOYS THEY'RE ROBBING THE BANK",
      "hypothesis": "Get your guns boys, they're robbing the bank.",
      "duration": 2.485,
      "total_time": 20.452197551727295,
      "first_token_latency": 0.45436739921569824,
      "avg_processing_time": 17.967197551727295
    },
    {
      "file_id": "7975-280084-0007",
      "speaker_id": "7975",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\7975\\280084\\7975-280084-0007.flac",
      "reference": "CHADWELL WOODS AND JIM RODE UP AND JOINED US SHOUTING TO PEOPLE IN THE STREET TO GET INSIDE AND FIRING THEIR PISTOLS TO EMPHASIZE THEIR COMMANDS",
      "hypothesis": "Chadwell Woods and Jim wrote up and joined us,",
      "duration": 8.04,
      "total_time": 17.355507373809814,
      "first_token_latency": 0.9291055202484131,
      "avg_processing_time": 9.315507373809815
    },
    {
      "file_id": "7975-280084-0008",
      "speaker_id": "7975",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\7975\\280084\\7975-280084-0008.flac",
      "reference": "IF ANY OF OUR PARTY SHOT HIM IT MUST HAVE BEEN WOODS",
      "hypothesis": "If any of our party shot him, it must have been Woods.",
      "duration": 3.05,
      "total_time": 20.005960702896118,
      "first_token_latency": 0.7631440162658691,
      "avg_processing_time": 16.955960702896117
    },
    {
      "file_id": "7975-280084-0010",
      "speaker_id": "7975",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\7975\\280084\\7975-280084-0010.flac",
      "reference": "EVERY TIME I SAW ANY ONE WITH A BEAD ON ME I WOULD DROP OFF MY HORSE AND TRY TO DRIVE THE SHOOTER INSIDE BUT I COULD NOT SEE IN EVERY DIRECTION",
      "hypothesis": "Every time I saw anyone with a bead on me,",
      "duration": 7.545,
      "total_time": 17.986265897750854,
      "first_token_latency": 2.0305681228637695,
      "avg_processing_time": 10.441265897750855
    },
    {
      "file_id": "7975-280084-0011",
      "speaker_id": "7975",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\7975\\280084\\7975-280084-0011.flac",
      "reference": "DOCTOR WHEELER WHO HAD GONE UPSTAIRS IN THE HOTEL SHOT MILLER AND HE LAY DYING IN THE STREET",
      "hypothesis": "Dr. Wheeler, who had gone upstairs in the hotel, shot Miller and he lay dying in the street.",
      "duration": 5.1850625,
      "total_time": 20.43364191055298,
      "first_token_latency": 0.42600321769714355,
      "avg_processing_time": 15.248579410552978
    },
    {
      "file_id": "7975-280084-0014",
      "speaker_id": "7975",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\7975\\280084\\7975-280084-0014.flac",
      "reference": "AS TO THE REST OF THE AFFAIR INSIDE THE BANK I TAKE THE ACCOUNT OF A NORTHFIELD NARRATOR",
      "hypothesis": "As to the rest of the affair inside the bank, I take the account of a Northfield narrator.",
      "duration": 5.275,
      "total_time": 20.539047718048096,
      "first_token_latency": 0.9232511520385742,
      "avg_processing_time": 15.264047718048095
    },
    {
      "file_id": "7975-280084-0015",
      "speaker_id": "7975",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\7975\\280084\\7975-280084-0015.flac",
      "reference": "WHERE'S THE MONEY OUTSIDE THE SAFE BOB ASKED",
      "hypothesis": "Where's the money outside the safe, Bob asked.",
      "duration": 2.81,
      "total_time": 20.042415142059326,
      "first_token_latency": 0.7881269454956055,
      "avg_processing_time": 17.232415142059327
    },
    {
      "file_id": "7975-280084-0016",
      "speaker_id": "7975",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\7975\\280084\\7975-280084-0016.flac",
      "reference": "THE SHUTTERS WERE CLOSED AND THIS CAUSED BUNKER AN INSTANT'S DELAY THAT WAS ALMOST FATAL PITTS CHASED HIM WITH A BULLET",
      "hypothesis": "The shutters were closed and this caused Bunker an instance delay that was almost fatal.",
      "duration": 6.3,
      "total_time": 18.256027936935425,
      "first_token_latency": 0.5256991386413574,
      "avg_processing_time": 11.956027936935424
    },
    {
      "file_id": "7975-280084-0017",
      "speaker_id": "7975",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\7975\\280084\\7975-280084-0017.flac",
      "reference": "THE FIRST ONE MISSED HIM BUT THE SECOND WENT THROUGH HIS RIGHT SHOULDER",
      "hypothesis": "The first one missed him, but the second went through his right shoulder.",
      "duration": 3.165,
      "total_time": 20.738912343978882,
      "first_token_latency": 0.7321550846099854,
      "avg_processing_time": 17.573912343978883
    },
    {
      "file_id": "7975-280085-0003",
      "speaker_id": "7975",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\7975\\280085\\7975-280085-0003.flac",
      "reference": "THAT DAY A MAN NAMED DUNNING DISCOVERED US AND WE TOOK HIM PRISONER",
      "hypothesis": "That day a man named Dunning discovered us and we took him prisoner.",
      "duration": 3.535,
      "total_time": 20.487658739089966,
      "first_token_latency": 0.8673465251922607,
      "avg_processing_time": 16.952658739089966
    },
    {
      "file_id": "7975-280085-0005",
      "speaker_id": "7975",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\7975\\280085\\7975-280085-0005.flac",
      "reference": "NO SOONER HOWEVER WAS HE RELEASED THAN HE MADE POSTHASTE INTO MANKATO TO ANNOUNCE OUR PRESENCE AND IN A FEW MINUTES ANOTHER POSSE WAS LOOKING FOR US",
      "hypothesis": "No sooner, however, was he released than he made post-haste into Mankato to announce our presence, and in a few minutes another posse was looking for us.",
      "duration": 8.845,
      "total_time": 21.14698886871338,
      "first_token_latency": 1.5331954956054688,
      "avg_processing_time": 12.301988868713378
    },
    {
      "file_id": "7975-280085-0006",
      "speaker_id": "7975",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\7975\\280085\\7975-280085-0006.flac",
      "reference": "THE WHISTLE ON THE OIL MILL BLEW AND WE FEARED THAT IT WAS A SIGNAL THAT HAD BEEN AGREED UPON TO ALARM THE TOWN IN CASE WE WERE OBSERVED BUT WE WERE NOT MOLESTED",
      "hypothesis": "The whistle on the oil mill blew, and we feared that it was a signal that had been agreed upon to alarm the town in case we were observed. But we were not molested.",
      "duration": 8.4,
      "total_time": 21.20167565345764,
      "first_token_latency": 1.1741766929626465,
      "avg_processing_time": 12.801675653457641
    },
    {
      "file_id": "7975-280085-0009",
      "speaker_id": "7975",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\7975\\280085\\7975-280085-0009.flac",
      "reference": "WE WERE IN SIGHT OF OUR LONG SOUGHT HORSES WHEN THEY CUT US OFF FROM THE ANIMALS AND OUR LAST HOPE WAS GONE",
      "hypothesis": "We were in sight of our long sawed horses when they cut us off from the animals and our last hope was",
      "duration": 6.02,
      "total_time": 20.586055517196655,
      "first_token_latency": 0.8738043308258057,
      "avg_processing_time": 14.566055517196656
    },
    {
      "file_id": "7975-280085-0010",
      "speaker_id": "7975",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\7975\\280085\\7975-280085-0010.flac",
      "reference": "SIX STEPPED TO THE FRONT SHERIFF GLISPIN COLONEL T L VOUGHT B M RICE G A BRADFORD C A POMEROY AND S J SEVERSON",
      "hypothesis": "Six steps to the front. Sheriff Glispin, Colonel T.",
      "duration": 9.365,
      "total_time": 18.318822860717773,
      "first_token_latency": 1.4958863258361816,
