      "total_time": 20.984132051467896,
      "first_token_latency": 1.4660429954528809,
      "avg_processing_time": 14.814132051467896
    },
    {
      "file_id": "7975-280085-0017",
      "speaker_id": "7975",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\7975\\280085\\7975-280085-0017.flac",
      "reference": "INCLUDING THOSE RECEIVED IN AND ON THE WAY FROM NORTHFIELD I HAD ELEVEN WOUNDS",
      "hypothesis": "including those received in and on the way from Northfield, I had 11 wounds.",
      "duration": 4.375,
      "total_time": 20.78044581413269,
      "first_token_latency": 1.280092716217041,
      "avg_processing_time": 16.40544581413269
    },
    {
      "file_id": "7975-280085-0018",
      "speaker_id": "7975",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\7975\\280085\\7975-280085-0018.flac",
      "reference": "AND SHERIFF GLISPIN'S ORDER NOT TO SHOOT WAS THE BEGINNING OF THE PROTECTORATE THAT MINNESOTA PEOPLE ESTABLISHED OVER US",
      "hypothesis": "And Sheriff Glispon's order not to shoot was the beginning of the protectorate that Minnesota people established over",
