      "total_time": 20.882270574569702,
      "first_token_latency": 1.4342594146728516,
      "avg_processing_time": 14.857270574569702
    },
    {
      "file_id": "8131-117016-0002",
      "speaker_id": "8131",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\8131\\117016\\8131-117016-0002.flac",
      "reference": "SOME OF MARS LAWS DATED FROM THE TIME WHEN LAW ENFORCEMENT HAD BEEN HAMPERED BY LACK OF MEN RATHER THAN BY THE TYPE OF MEN",
      "hypothesis": "Some of Mars' laws dated from the time when law enforcement had been hampered by lack of men, rather than by the type of men.",
      "duration": 8.29,
      "total_time": 21.094292402267456,
      "first_token_latency": 1.1430330276489258,
      "avg_processing_time": 12.804292402267457
    },
    {
      "file_id": "8131-117016-0003",
      "speaker_id": "8131",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\8131\\117016\\8131-117016-0003.flac",
      "reference": "THE STONEWALL GANG NUMBERED PERHAPS FIVE HUNDRED",
      "hypothesis": "The Stonewall Gang numbered perhaps 500.",
      "duration": 3.665,
      "total_time": 20.807035207748413,
      "first_token_latency": 0.8463280200958252,
      "avg_processing_time": 17.142035207748414
    },
    {
      "file_id": "8131-117016-0004",
      "speaker_id": "8131",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\8131\\117016\\8131-117016-0004.flac",
      "reference": "EVEN DERELICTS AND FAILURES HAD TO EAT THERE WERE STORES AND SHOPS THROUGHOUT THE DISTRICT WHICH EKED OUT SOME KIND OF A MARGINAL LIVING",
      "hypothesis": "Even derelicts and failures had to eat. There were stories and shops throughout the district which eked out some kind of a marginal living.",
      "duration": 9.45,
      "total_time": 21.07591724395752,
      "first_token_latency": 1.1433651447296143,
      "avg_processing_time": 11.62591724395752
    },
    {
      "file_id": "8131-117016-0005",
      "speaker_id": "8131",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\8131\\117016\\8131-117016-0005.flac",
      "reference": "THEY WERE SAFE FROM PROTECTION RACKETEERS THERE NONE BOTHERED TO COME SO FAR OUT",
      "hypothesis": "They were safe from protection racketeers there. None bothered to come so far out.",
      "duration": 6.3,
      "total_time": 21.341529607772827,
      "first_token_latency": 1.3502576351165771,
      "avg_processing_time": 15.041529607772826
    },
    {
      "file_id": "8131-117016-0006",
      "speaker_id": "8131",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\8131\\117016\\8131-117016-0006.flac",
      "reference": "THE SHOPKEEPERS AND SOME OF THE LESS UNFORTUNATE PEOPLE THERE HAD PROTESTED LOUD ENOUGH TO REACH CLEAR BACK TO EARTH",
      "hypothesis": "The shopkeepers and some of the less unfortunate people there had protested loud enough to reach clear back to earth.",
      "duration": 7.66,
      "total_time": 20.60253381729126,
      "first_token_latency": 0.9675781726837158,
      "avg_processing_time": 12.94253381729126
    },
    {
      "file_id": "8131-117016-0010",
      "speaker_id": "8131",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\8131\\117016\\8131-117016-0010.flac",
      "reference": "I'VE GOT A FREE HAND AND WE'RE GOING TO RUN THIS THE WAY WE WOULD ON EARTH",
      "hypothesis": "I've got a free hand and we're going to run this the way we would on earth.",
      "duration": 5.11,
      "total_time": 20.802051067352295,
      "first_token_latency": 0.8284549713134766,
      "avg_processing_time": 15.692051067352295
    },
    {
      "file_id": "8131-117016-0011",
      "speaker_id": "8131",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\8131\\117016\\8131-117016-0011.flac",
      "reference": "YOUR JOB IS TO PROTECT THE CITIZENS HERE AND THAT MEANS EVERYONE NOT BREAKING THE LAWS WHETHER YOU FEEL LIKE IT OR NOT NO GRAFT",
      "hypothesis": "Your job is to protect the citizens here, and that means everyone not breaking the laws, whether you feel like it or not. No graft.",
      "duration": 10.245,
      "total_time": 21.091185808181763,
      "first_token_latency": 1.221682071685791,
      "avg_processing_time": 10.846185808181763
    },
    {
      "file_id": "8131-117016-0012",
      "speaker_id": "8131",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\8131\\117016\\8131-117016-0012.flac",
      "reference": "THE FIRST MAN MAKING A SHAKEDOWN WILL GET THE SAME TREATMENT WE'RE GOING TO USE ON THE STONEWALL BOYS YOU'LL GET DOUBLE PAY HERE AND YOU CAN LIVE ON IT",
      "hypothesis": "The first man making a shakedown will get the same treatment we're going to use on the Stonewall Boys. You'll get double pay here, and you can live on it.",
      "duration": 9.49,
      "total_time": 21.495357751846313,
      "first_token_latency": 1.5493695735931396,
      "avg_processing_time": 12.005357751846313
    },
    {
      "file_id": "8131-117016-0014",
      "speaker_id": "8131",
      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\8131\\117016\\8131-117016-0014.flac",
      "reference": "THE REST OF YOU CAN TEAM UP ANY WAY YOU WANT TONIGHT PICK ANY ROUTE THAT'S OPEN OKAY MEN LET'S GO",
      "hypothesis": "The rest of you can team up any way you want tonight. Pick any route that's open. . Okay men, let's go.",
