      "audio_path": "c:\\Users\\VRSTUDIO3\\Desktop\\STiTy-main1\\LibriSpeech\\test-other\\8131\\117016\\8131-117016-0018.flac",
      "reference": "HE BEGAN WONDERING ABOUT SECURITY THEN",
      "hypothesis": "He began wondering about security then.",
